@startuml mtga-agent-graph-loop
title Local Agent Graph - Bounded Execution Loop
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> ReceiveIntent
ReceiveIntent --> LoadLocalContext
LoadLocalContext --> EnsureCatalog
EnsureCatalog --> Plan
Plan --> PolicyCheck
PolicyCheck --> ExecuteTool : allowlisted read
PolicyCheck --> AwaitApproval : proposed local effect
PolicyCheck --> Refused : forbidden capability
AwaitApproval --> ExecuteTool : exact arguments approved
AwaitApproval --> Cancelled : declined or expired
ExecuteTool --> Observe
Observe --> Evaluate
Evaluate --> Plan : more work within budget
Evaluate --> Completed : deterministic goal reached
Evaluate --> Failed : error, deadline or budget reached
Refused --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Completed --> [*]
Failed --> [*]

note right of PolicyCheck
  Initial hard limits:
  max steps = 8
  max tool calls = 6
  same tool + arguments <= 2
  active run deadline = 30 seconds
end note
note right of Observe
  Persist every transition with run ID,
  step ID, outcome and redacted evidence.
  Effects require an idempotency key.
end note
@enduml
